{"id":"665229","name":"玉米面棒棒馍（煎）","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/665229/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"中筋面粉","amount":"200克"},{"name":"玉米面","amount":"100克"},{"name":"开水","amount":"100克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"3克"},{"name":"糖","amount":"30克"},{"name":"猪油","amount":"10克"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"克细玉米面加入100克开水烫面。","img":"images/665229/step_1.png"},{"step":2,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665229/step_2.png"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入两个鸡蛋，再次搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665229/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"不烫手时，加入30克糖，10克猪油。","img":"images/665229/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"克面粉。","img":"images/665229/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"克酵母。","img":"images/665229/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌至大面絮。","img":"images/665229/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"下手揉成一个光滑的面团。","img":"images/665229/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"不要发酵，直接搓成长条，切成均等的小剂子。","img":"images/665229/step_9.png"},{"step":10,"desc":"分别搓成纺锤状。","img":"images/665229/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"依次放入锅中（锅中刷薄油），中间留出空隙，盖上锅盖，醒发至两倍大（40分钟左右）。","img":"images/665229/step_11.png"},{"step":12,"desc":"开火，稍煎一下，至底部微微焦黄。","img":"images/665229/step_12.png"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入漠过馒头1/3的水。","img":"images/665229/step_13.png"},{"step":14,"desc":"盖上锅盖，大火，焖干水分（12分钟左右）。","img":"images/665229/step_14.png"},{"step":15,"desc":"底部焦香酥脆，松软香甜。","img":"images/665229/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"好了，来一张成品图来一张。","img":"images/665229/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"蓬松暄软，营养又健康。","img":"images/665229/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}